; Isolated npm auth for this repo. Keep machine-wide ~/.npmrc out of the build
; so DSharp/Azure feed settings cannot leak into Digitaltableteur installs.
;
; Private @digitaltableteur/* packages require registry read auth on clean
; installs. Provide a read-only npm token through NPM_TOKEN locally, or map the
; GitHub secret NPM_READ_TOKEN/NPM_TOKEN to the NPM_TOKEN environment variable
; in workflows. Never commit a concrete token value here.
//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
